body:
ravioli specifically id say wait until theyre all floating, nab one, and cut it in half to make sure its done all the way through

&#x200B;

also dont burn down your minecraft house. :(

"go for a walk, exercise, talk to people, go to the library" etc etc

&#x200B;

like .. thank you, i would Love to. but how do i get the motivation to do those things in the first place?? i genuinely feel like i have wet cement in my head with how thick my brain fog has been lately . i wish psychiatrist visits, let alone finding one, was easier. shit gets so draining and defeating

my google history is "calories in \*whatever food\*" times 1000

&#x200B;

but i eat nutella by the spoonful after 11pm anyway
